{"id": "q0459", "pool": "easy-chat", "tier": "conservative", "audio_s": 3.27, "n_chunks": 4, "n_concurrent": 4, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.1793, "eot_read_ms": 21, "reference_answer": null, "query": "What are some basic spirits you should have at your bar", "transcript": "What are some basic spirits you should have at your bar?", "mode": "local", "answer": "When it comes to basic spirits for a bar, the most common ones are rum, whiskey, gin, vodka, and tequila. These are the core spirits that form the foundation of many cocktails.", "answer_ms": 922}
